      "jcr:created": "Wed Jan 08 2025 15:50:51 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">With <b>over&nbsp;one million procedures completed</b>,&nbsp;Mako Total Knee has transformed orthopaedics with its revolutionary technology and clinical outcomes. ​&nbsp;The unique features of Mako SmartRobotics™, and the powerful combination with Triathlon are designed to help surgeons achieve Functional Knee Positioning™ through 3D CT-based implant planning, dynamic joint balancing and AccuStop™ haptic technology. Mako Total Knee allows you to know more about your patient, so you can cut less.</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 21 2025 19:13:17 GMT+0000",
